[SPEAKER_08]: If I get distracted moving back and forth, it's just some of the paperwork I have to kind of present a brief introduction to the budget this evening.

33
00:02:16,531 --> 00:02:21,933
[SPEAKER_08]: Before you on the police side of services is a 14-625087 budget.

34
00:02:23,314 --> 00:02:32,497
[SPEAKER_08]: On paper, it represents a 1.2% deduction from the prior fiscal year's budget as it relates to police services.

35
