[SPEAKER_08]: So budget as before, the biggest

41
00:03:11,524 --> 00:03:25,676
[SPEAKER_08]: impact you'll see is the unfilled positions 10 patrol positions they have unfilled will be unfunded for this fiscal year, and we do that in 2020 of the fiscal year.

