00:06:53,301 --> 00:06:54,602
[SPEAKER_08]: individuals in crisis, right.

73
00:06:54,942 --> 00:07:02,406
[SPEAKER_08]: And the one thing that's sort of excluded, which changes the thing would be firearms, you know, if you're under the firearm, it trains the changes a little bit of the way that the escalation.

74
00:07:03,646 --> 00:07:16,573
[SPEAKER_08]: But quite frankly, it is essentially should be looked at as de escalation training, we have completed that training for every single police officer all the way up to my level, I go through the de escalation, it's not something we just put in patrol levels, we, we are dedicated to it, we impact

75
00:07:18,034 --> 00:07:24,179
[SPEAKER_08]: We believe we impact our offices in our city tremendously when we put these sort of trainings.

76
00:07:24,619 --> 00:07:26,521
