78
00:07:29,623 --> 00:07:31,685
[SPEAKER_08]: It provides a better form of police services.

79
00:07:32,465 --> 00:07:36,969
[SPEAKER_08]: Part of the state mandated trainings that every police officer also underwent was duty to intervene.

80
00:07:37,209 --> 00:07:38,690
[SPEAKER_08]: We of course had our legal updates.

81
00:07:38,730 --> 00:07:41,913
