00:53:32,650 --> 00:53:41,137
[SPEAKER_08]: We want a community to look at, you know, I don't want this this image is, you know, I wear my uniform for a reason, right?

638
00:53:42,158 --> 00:53:43,639
[SPEAKER_08]: I don't want people to fear this uniform.

639
00:53:44,761 --> 00:53:48,664
[SPEAKER_08]: And so I try to smile and laugh and interact and I want all my officers to do that.

640
00:53:49,324 --> 00:53:50,745
[SPEAKER_08]: And I know it's not as simple as that.

