643
00:53:59,630 --> 00:54:05,634
[SPEAKER_08]: And I know that people look at the police sometimes as very oppressing and the hope that we can change that one day.

644
00:54:05,674 --> 00:54:05,834
[SPEAKER_08]: Right.

645
00:54:05,934 --> 00:54:08,216
[SPEAKER_08]: And I'm not saying it's going to be easy, but that's sort of the issue.

646
00:54:08,236 --> 00:54:10,217
[SPEAKER_08]: And it's an overwhelming problem that

647
00:54:10,679 --> 00:54:14,523
[SPEAKER_08]: police chiefs face in this country is that how do you get this underreporting of hate crimes to address it.

648
00:54:15,164 --> 00:54:20,730
[SPEAKER_08]: So it's we're aware of it, looking for solutions, but trying to address what we can do right now.

649
00:54:21,623 --> 00:54:31,508
