00:54:31,788 --> 00:54:34,289
[SPEAKER_11]: That was, it was nice to see them there and interacting with people.

651
00:54:34,329 --> 00:54:37,391
[SPEAKER_11]: So I appreciate the work that you guys are trying to do.

652
00:54:37,471 --> 00:54:47,316
[SPEAKER_11]: And I mean, in the future, I hope we can, you know, create even more opportunities for forums where we can build that trust within, you know, our community.

