1050
01:22:08,363 --> 01:22:22,377
[SPEAKER_08]: I don't think the process should be that the residents of the neighborhood could come here and then the traffic was to say, yeah, go ahead and put that light up and then you know the DPW commissioners looking at me said, who's going to pay for that because you just, you know, you're looking at approving a budget that doesn't have anywhere near the amount of funds to do that.

1051
01:22:24,128 --> 01:22:28,291
[SPEAKER_08]: What's changed for us in the city right now is we've have a traffic engineer.

1052
01:22:28,331 --> 01:22:31,233
[SPEAKER_08]: So, you know, Todd and Amy do a tremendous amount of work.

1053
01:22:31,713 --> 01:22:45,442
[SPEAKER_08]: And so I'm working with the traffic commission to kind of think about and understand the process that maybe the neighborhoods need to go through the engineers and they should look at budgets and what they have and what projects are lined up and design things and come up with ideas.

1054
01:22:46,613 --> 01:22:47,774
[SPEAKER_08]: because I'm not a traffic engineer.

1055
01:22:47,814 --> 01:22:55,277
[SPEAKER_08]: I know Todd and Amy show up at all the meetings, but if, if, if neighborhood comes and says, we want, you know, a four way intersection with lights there here on there.

1056
01:22:55,297 --> 01:22:56,537
[SPEAKER_08]: And I'm like, okay, good, go ahead.

1057
01:22:56,557 --> 01:23:00,239
[SPEAKER_08]: And then they come back and say that $6 million and I'm looking at it.

1058
01:23:00,339 --> 01:23:04,881
[SPEAKER_08]: Rather have a go through that process first and whatever's proved, have that full approved plan.

1059
01:23:04,901 --> 01:23:06,222
[SPEAKER_08]: That's already been vetted through the city.

1060
01:23:06,562 --> 01:23:08,923
[SPEAKER_08]: The traffic engineers have already come up with plans and designs.

1061
01:23:09,003 --> 01:23:13,165
[SPEAKER_08]: We know that where it is that comes to the traffic commission and then we rule on that.

1062
01:23:14,205 --> 01:23:39,682
[SPEAKER_08]: the community input could be there but then when we do talk with the community and we present these plans there's at least some science behind it or some some thought behind it rather than you know I mean I'm a police chief we have an economic development the DPW commission but you know I know a lot about road safety but I'm not a traffic engineer I think the process is just just needs to be tweaked and how they started and how they get there we've become accustomed in the city to sending everybody the traffic commission for a solution

1063
01:23:40,147 --> 01:23:44,072
[SPEAKER_08]: And yeah, it's easy for me if you want me to decide there's a stop sign, right?

1064
01:23:44,452 --> 01:23:49,338
[SPEAKER_08]: But when you want to redesign intersections, it's fast becoming one of the major issues.

1065
01:23:49,378 --> 01:23:57,348
[SPEAKER_08]: Everybody wants their corner redesigned and intersections and major intersections, but it's faulty to come directly to the traffic commission with that.

1066
01:23:57,768 --> 01:23:59,028
[SPEAKER_08]: I think we should just reverting it back.

1067
01:23:59,088 --> 01:24:02,829
[SPEAKER_08]: I think it should be going to the because the prioritization of they already do this.

1068
01:24:02,889 --> 01:24:04,049
[SPEAKER_08]: They already prioritize projects.

1069
01:24:04,069 --> 01:24:05,550
[SPEAKER_08]: They already know where the funding's coming from.

1070
01:24:05,830 --> 01:24:13,991
[SPEAKER_08]: They already know how to do the job and ultimately, when that is all designed and done, it comes to the traffic commission for approval because we approve regulatory tech techs, right?

1071
01:24:14,471 --> 01:24:18,472
[SPEAKER_08]: And so, we we have the authority to approve a a traffic light in this thing.

1072
01:24:18,712 --> 01:24:19,832
[SPEAKER_08]: It's not the design of it.

1073
01:24:19,912 --> 01:24:20,933
[SPEAKER_08]: It's just that the fact that it

1074
01:24:24,140 --> 01:24:28,961
[SPEAKER_08]: Yeah, community import, but I think it has to go in a different direction, not just a traffic commission.

1075
01:24:29,001 --> 01:24:29,861
[SPEAKER_08]: I can't go directly to it.

1076
01:24:29,881 --> 01:24:31,722
[SPEAKER_08]: So I hope that made sense when I sort of explained it.

1077
01:24:31,822 --> 01:24:32,882
[SPEAKER_12]: Yeah, no, I appreciate it.

1078
01:24:32,942 --> 01:24:34,963
[SPEAKER_12]: Just to kind of give a little follow up in a little more detail.

1079
01:24:34,983 --> 01:24:37,703
[SPEAKER_12]: I'm going to try to avoid litigating a very specific case.

1080
01:24:38,124 --> 01:24:47,866
