1273
01:44:18,874 --> 01:44:22,778
[SPEAKER_03]: So confirmation cards are being in the process of being mailed out.

1274
01:44:23,818 --> 01:44:29,183
[SPEAKER_03]: They'll go out, the inactive voters will be notified that you are now on the inactive list.

1275
01:44:29,223 --> 01:44:36,970
[SPEAKER_03]: If you wanna vote, you either need to do the census or you need to sign an affirmation and show ID at a polling location to vote.

1276
