[SPEAKER_03]: That makes you an active voter.

1277
01:44:41,303 --> 01:44:51,851
[SPEAKER_03]: My hope is that I do not have to spend that much money, as much money as I spent this year, to send out the annual street listing and then the confirmation notices.

1278
01:44:55,154 --> 01:44:55,354
[SPEAKER_01]: So.

1279
01:44:55,374 --> 01:44:56,475
[SPEAKER_01]: Great.

1280
01:44:56,755 --> 01:44:57,276
[SPEAKER_01]: Thank you very much.

