[SPEAKER_03]: Okay.

1341
01:49:02,562 --> 01:49:06,404
[SPEAKER_03]: So that very well could be my own error.

1342
01:49:06,484 --> 01:49:16,610
[SPEAKER_03]: But when I look at professional services and training, professional services, the money could come from there for those postcards.

1343
