1345
01:49:27,850 --> 01:49:35,333
[SPEAKER_03]: And then I don't want to mail the polling location postcards until the end of July.

1346
01:49:36,619 --> 01:49:43,725
[SPEAKER_03]: right at the end of July so that you've got, and there'll be other ways that we can put where you're voting.

1347
01:49:45,066 --> 01:49:50,691
[SPEAKER_03]: Mass.gov, the Secretary of State site is absolutely fabulous for anybody who has access to a computer.

1348
01:49:51,251 --> 01:49:52,132
[SPEAKER_03]: You can go right there.

1349
01:49:52,152 --> 01:49:53,813
[SPEAKER_03]: It will tell you where you go to vote.

1350
01:49:54,434 --> 01:50:01,239
[SPEAKER_03]: So we want to do reverse robocalls and send out a postcard and post

