1360
01:51:14,760 --> 01:51:16,041
[SPEAKER_03]: No, I don't believe so.

1361
01:51:16,281 --> 01:51:23,526
[SPEAKER_03]: And by using the poll pads, the beauty of the poll pad is it is an electronic device that is not connected to wifi.

1362
