1397
01:54:47,751 --> 01:54:55,378
[SPEAKER_12]: Facilities Managers, oh, and it's actually not a manager, it's Facilities and Grounds Director is the title of the position, and it's 96,638.

1398
01:54:55,938 --> 01:55:00,522
[SPEAKER_12]: And that position manages zero headcount employees.

1399
01:55:01,163 --> 01:55:14,134
[SPEAKER_12]: Is there any department head, and since the one example is actually not a manager, it's director, is there any department head that manages up to 90 full-time and part-time employees per year that is only being paid at a rate of $70,000 per year?

1400
01:55:17,569 --> 01:55:18,632
[SPEAKER_05]: Thank you vice president bears.

1401
01:55:18,972 --> 01:55:27,173
[SPEAKER_05]: So, I am not able to answer that question at this point in time I'd have to analyze different pieces of information but allow me for one moment to.

1402
01:55:27,990 --> 01:55:32,492
[SPEAKER_05]: explain the process that the city went through to determine the appropriate CAF on this.

1403
01:55:32,632 --> 01:55:48,241
[SPEAKER_05]: And I will also say that the city looks at these types of ranges and these types of CAFs, not only using data that comes from external sources, but also looks at that information from the purposes,

1404
01:55:49,790 --> 01:55:53,091
[SPEAKER_05]: perspective of internal equity and that's critically important here.

1405
01:55:54,071 --> 01:56:03,775
[SPEAKER_05]: So we received information that we collected through our human resources department as to positions for elections department head type roles.

1406
01:56:04,535 --> 01:56:10,197
[SPEAKER_05]: In addition, Sandy, our elections coordinator Gail was kind enough to share information that

1407
01:56:10,882 --> 01:56:13,664
[SPEAKER_05]: she had collected from other communities.

1408
01:56:14,324 --> 01:56:26,833
[SPEAKER_05]: When taking out communities that are not the same size or not even comparable to the same size of the city of Medford, we found ourselves in a reasonable range to assign a CAF 12 to this position.

1409
01:56:27,353 --> 01:56:30,355
[SPEAKER_05]: Obviously, this would need to go before the council to be CAFed.

1410
01:56:31,516 --> 01:56:38,621
[SPEAKER_05]: And obviously, when we looked at that data, all of that data, plus we considered the information that was

1411
01:56:39,132 --> 01:56:45,116
[SPEAKER_05]: in front of us with other CAFs across the organization, we develop the CAF that is being presented here.

1412
01:56:45,476 --> 01:56:57,483
[SPEAKER_05]: The CAF that is shown is the lowest step one of that range, which is not uncommon for the city to potentially have four different positions when it is posting a position.

