1482
02:04:14,655 --> 02:04:23,942
[SPEAKER_05]: That original submission had a amount of part-time salaries for poll workers as $55,000, despite the statements that were made here tonight.

1483
02:04:25,348 --> 02:04:35,537
[SPEAKER_05]: Furthermore, this revised budget was shared with coordinator Gail and at the time we did discuss and discuss back and forth the matter of.

1484
02:04:37,117 --> 02:04:39,618
[SPEAKER_05]: the fact that one position could be removed.

1485
02:04:39,738 --> 02:04:43,640
[SPEAKER_05]: Coordinator Gale appeared to be in support of that.

1486
02:04:43,680 --> 02:04:46,541
[SPEAKER_05]: And we have email communication exchange on that subject.

1487
02:04:47,641 --> 02:04:49,322
[SPEAKER_05]: In fact, I felt very supported.

1488
02:04:49,362 --> 02:04:58,906
