[SPEAKER_03]: in the registrar voters office, the elections department.

1503
02:06:48,706 --> 02:06:51,169
[SPEAKER_03]: That's not what I'm disputing at all.

1504
02:06:52,751 --> 02:06:58,177
[SPEAKER_03]: The office, as I said, has been maintained for a long time.

1505
02:06:59,433 --> 02:07:05,194
[SPEAKER_03]: it was maintained with two full-time people and one temporary person.

1506
02:07:05,354 --> 02:07:10,216
[SPEAKER_03]: In 2019, that third person was brought on as permanent full-time.

1507
02:07:10,296 --> 02:07:17,697
[SPEAKER_03]: So I absolutely did and had communication with Chief of Staff Nazarian about that.

1508
02:07:17,917 --> 02:07:21,378
[SPEAKER_03]: It was which position were we going to do away with?

1509
02:07:21,978 --> 02:07:27,240
[SPEAKER_03]: So the office is still maintained by three full-time staff.

